        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Omnia 7504/52-US32D, Brushed Stainless Steel Square Cup Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThis contemporary square stainless steel cup pull from Omnia hardware is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches, and abrasions. It has a brushed stainless steel finish. It is pressure mounted into the door for a screw-less installation. The Brushed Stainless Steel Square Cup Pull is for use on pocket doors, sliding doors, sliding barn doors, or cabinet doors. Use on any lightweight or sliding door where a flush with the door face pull is desired.\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nAlso available: <a href=\"/products/solid-brass-square-cup-pull-omnia-7504-52\"><b>Solid Brass Square Cup Pull</b></a> and <a href=\"/products/contemporary-round-stainless-steel-cup-pull-omnia-7503-52-us32d\"><b>Omnia 7503/52 Round Stainless Steel Cup Pull</b></a>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Omnia 7504 Stainless Square Flush Cup Pull:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: .050\" Thick Solid Stainless Steel</li>\r\n<li>Finish: <b>Brushed Stainless Steel</b></li>\r\n<li>Overall Length: 2-3/16\" square</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Diameter: 1-7/8\"</li>\r\n<li>Mounting Hole Depth: 1/4\"</li>\r\n<li>Projection: 1/16\"</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/7504-template.pdf?v=1704262252\"><b>Omnia 7504 Dimensional Diagram (PDF)\r\n</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<i>Sold Individually</i>\r\n</p>",
