                "title": "Square Stainless Steel Cup Pull",
                "description": "Omnia 7504 cup pulls. This contemporary square stainless steel cup pull from Omnia hardware is resistant to corrosion, knocks, scratches and abrasions. Warm satin stainless steel finish. They are pressure mounted into the door for a clean installation (no screws). For use on pocket doors, sliding doors, sliding barn doors or cabinet doors. Use on any door where a Flush with the door face pull is desired.",
